Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:15:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Atomically claim a legacy daemon locator across projects
 before attachment

Use the existing process-wide metadata row as the reservation after discovery and before any Project starts the client. Preserve low-level APIs, do not create provisional records for failed new spawns, and notify shared metadata without holding a Project lease. Add a deterministic two-window two-project conflicting-client regression.
